scenario=exploratory Ag70 P1P, fresh 300 K initial state, 4.0 mW composite source
P1P evaporation model=enabled, Wang et al. 2024 p_sat fit; derived Clausius-Clapeyron Lv; Table 8 alpha knots 1373-1773 K
P1P_ALPHA_EV=0.1428 (fallback sensitivity only outside alpha anchor range; table alpha takes precedence within 1373-1773 K)
P1P_AG_VAPOR_PRESSURE_PA=0 (free-evaporation upper-bound scenario; not actual arc gas partial pressure)
arc pressure=501 MPa exploratory, periodic Gaussian, radius 5 nm
Marangoni=on, tangential multiplier 3; normal surface tension unchanged
max simulation time=7 ps, dt_max=20 fs, no production restart; compile-time field snapshots disabled except initial/hold event, checkpoint interval 1 ps
Ag mass bookkeeping density=constant reference density in component ledger; thermal expansion/density-change model not included
